# Boost on 32's end save (AUTHORING.md, Boosts): party strength only, the story stays played.
# HP and PP refilled (party-level, the four moves set again).
# For TRAINER_COMMANDER_SATURN_VALOR_CAVERN (KADABRA, BRONZOR, TOXICROAK: Crunch, Crunch (Levitate), Earthquake) and the
# drained lake's grunts.
party-level 0 65
party-move 0 0 MOVE_EARTHQUAKE
